             "text": [
                {
                   "text": "#### The Order of Addition\n\nIn the previous lesson, we learned to **walk** among the numbers. Each step added 1, and we discovered that any number added to 0 stays the same: that is the **Additive Identity**.\n\nIn this text, we will explore in more depth the order in which we perform the addition of two numbers.",
