         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### The Order Does Not Change Anything\n\nLet us play a trick with two calculations:\n\n4 + 1 = 5\n1 + 4 = 5\n\nBoth reach 5! On the axis, starting at 4 and taking 1 step arrives at 5. Starting at 1 and taking 4 steps also arrives at 5. The order of the numbers does not matter. This rule is the **Commutative Axiom**:\n\n**a + b = b + a**",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg width=\"600\" height=\"210\" fill=\"none\" font-family=\"Arial\"><g font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#2C3E50\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"45\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><circle cx=\"56\" cy=\"45\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><circle cx=\"82\" cy=\"45\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><circle cx=\"108\" cy=\"45\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><text x=\"134\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\">+</text><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"45\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><text x=\"188\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\">=</text><circle cx=\"214\" cy=\"45\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"45\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><circle cx=\"266\" cy=\"45\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><circle cx=\"292\" cy=\"45\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><circle cx=\"318\" cy=\"45\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><text x=\"174\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#555\">4 + 1 = 5</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"128\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"middle\">+</text><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"128\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><circle cx=\"106\" cy=\"128\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><circle cx=\"132\" cy=\"128\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><circle cx=\"158\" cy=\"128\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><text x=\"186\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"middle\">=</text><circle cx=\"214\" cy=\"128\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"128\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><circle cx=\"266\" cy=\"128\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><circle cx=\"292\" cy=\"128\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><circle cx=\"318\" cy=\"128\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E44AD\"/><text x=\"174\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#555\">1 + 4 = 5</text></g></svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Graphic 2</b>: The same five fruits, no matter the order.</p>",
