         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this lesson, we discovered two powerful rules. The **Additive Identity** tells us that adding 0 to any number leaves it unchanged: 5 + 0 = 5. And the **Commutative Axiom** tells us that the order of addition does not matter: 4 + 1 = 1 + 4.\n\nNow you are ready to keep moving among the numbers!",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
